<div className="om-auto-card"><span className="om-label">WATCH THE PRISON DAY</span><h3>{hud.autoDay ? "Your inmate is on autopilot" : "Let the day unfold"}</h3><p>Auto follows count, collects food and sits to eat, completes your assigned duties, joins conversations and sleeps in your bunk after lights out. Use 1×, 2× or 4× to set the pace.</p><button className="om-btn om-primary om-wide" @click={toggleAutoDay}>{hud.autoDay ? "Take control" : "Start Auto day"}</button><small>{hud.autoDay ? hud.autoAction : "Give orders while Auto runs: they join the order list and are carried out when possible. Purchases and promises remain your choices."}</small><small>Pause and menus still pause the game; switching away only pauses it when "Keep running when not in focus" is off. Challenges need your answer.</small></div>
<div className="om-note">{jobSummary}</div><button className="om-btn om-wide om-primary" @click={toggleRoutine}>{hud.mode === "Routine" ? "Break routine: take manual control" : "Resume automatic routine"}</button>
<p className="om-small">Routine mode attends counts, eats, works and rests. Any move or interaction switches to manual control. Return to routine when you are done.</p>
<button className={"om-btn om-wide "+(hud.sprint?"is-active":"")} @click={toggleSprint}>{hud.sprint ? "Running enabled — switch to walking" : "Enable running"}</button><small>Running uses more energy and attracts attention. Returning to routine switches running off.</small>
<div className="om-section-title">WORK IS ALSO ACCESS</div><button className="om-btn om-wide" @click={() => requestAction("noticeboard","assignment")}>Walk to the work noticeboard</button>
#each (j in workCards) key={j.id}<div className={"om-card "+(j.selected?"selected":"")}><div className="om-row om-between"><h3>{j.name}</h3>#if (j.selected)<span className="om-chip">ASSIGNED</span>#end</div><p>{j.description}</p><small>{"On this detail: " + j.colleagues}</small><button className="om-btn om-wide" disabled={j.disabled || j.selected} @click={() => selectJob(j.id)}>Request assignment</button><small>{j.reason}</small></div>#end
<div className="om-section-title">THE PRISON DAY</div>
#each (r in routineCards) key={r.id}<div className={"om-schedule-entry "+(r.current?"current":"")}><time>{r.time}</time><strong>{r.name}</strong><p>{r.hint}</p></div>#end
